
# GlobalOnlineVisaApplications

A website for a private visa assistance agency helping customers
understand and prepare for visa application processes worldwide.

## Website Features

- Homepage introducing the agency
- Visa assistance services
- Online visa enquiry form
- Contact form
- Administrator login page
- Administrator dashboard for viewing applications
- Privacy policy
- Customer submission confirmation page
- Supabase database integration

